+So catalog\_v4's wider acceptance recovers a fraction of what training on pp gives on pp events, $0.15$ to $0.35$ of
+it in log over the groups and regions, and nothing inside catalog\_v3's coverage, where pp training reweights the same
+support and catalog\_v4 spreads the same steps wider. The direct numbers lean on Muon: if Muon helped the pp-trained arm
